			"notes": {
				"rationale": "The modal-passive sich lassen ('can be done'): the window can be opened. sich is a member by the reflexive test, so lässt sich is VERB sich lassen and öffnen a target of its own (de/causative-lassen, de/verb-owns-its-scattered-members, #723 ruling 10). Its identity waits on #766; until then it follows the convention for a reflexive member, lexicallyReflexive Yes and the Canonical Form sich lassen."
